Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.74,0:00:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mighty Little Defenders 11 – New Wild Cosmos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}The Amazing Bulala
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Episode 2
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.38,0:12:36.94,end,,0,0,0,,To be continued
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.11,0:00:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a cave
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.30,0:00:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,rift
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.90,0:00:36.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is the mysterious man Wolffy and I met in the rift?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.59,0:00:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if we can go back through the rift.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.18,0:00:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Speaking of which, what about Wolffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.10,0:00:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.52,0:00:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.64,0:00:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,where are you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.19,0:00:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,This is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.19,0:00:54.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy’s hat
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.40,0:01:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.31,0:01:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Why does a rift appear in grassland?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.39,0:01:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I suspect it has something to do with the explosion last night
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.67,0:01:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Humphrey
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.34,0:01:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I, Planie, am here to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.24,0:01:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It would be great if you came
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.24,0:01:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Only you can solve this matter
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.56,0:01:50.99,Default,,0,0,0,,This time it all depends on you, Slowy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.35,0:01:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,let me see
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.04,0:01:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,this kind of thing
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.00,0:01:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven’t seen it either
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.47,0:02:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I need some tools to investigate
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.15,0:02:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Slowy, I’ll go get the toolbox for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.08,0:02:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Slowy, toolbox
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.40,0:02:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you met Weslie?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.88,0:02:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m going to find Weslie right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.63,0:02:15.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie is missing
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.63,0:02:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,We can’t find him anywhere
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.89,0:02:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Could he have gone to find Wolffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.28,0:02:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Not good
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.52,0:02:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy is missing
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.68,0:02:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolnie
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.80,0:02:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,did you see him
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.00,0:02:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy didn’t come back all night
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.21,0:02:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,what happened
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.12,0:02:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Look
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.12,0:02:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Such exquisite Bulala
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.24,0:02:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t know if this Bulala can be eaten.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.53,0:02:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I have never seen such a big Bulala before
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.40,0:02:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It hurts so much
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.80,0:02:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.86,0:03:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Monster, don’t come here
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.98,0:03:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,hello
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.30,0:03:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t eat me
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.86,0:03:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.34,0:03:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You are Planie
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.94,0:03:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Humphrey save me
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.34,0:03:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Humphrey, Tyger
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.26,0:03:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Why have you turned into fur dolls?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.02,0:03:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to Goats’ Village?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.34,0:03:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What Goats’ Village
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.29,0:03:26.79,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the Bulala City
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.27,0:03:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Ragdolls Tyger and Big Humphrey
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.75,0:03:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,and
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.55,0:03:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Bulala City?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.15,0:03:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,In other corners of the universe
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.18,0:03:37.63,Default,,0,0,0,,There may also be various wonderful worlds
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.95,0:03:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be that the rift leads to other worlds?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.31,0:03:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You don’t have to be afraid
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.47,0:03:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m not a monster
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.35,0:03:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m from somewhere else
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.30,0:03:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,want to find someone
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.02,0:03:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t know if you have seen him
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.36,0:03:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It turns out he’s from other towns.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.76,0:03:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you looking for?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.08,0:03:56.23,Default,,0,0,0,,he is a wolf
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.63,0:04:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Probably something like this
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.84,0:04:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It turns out that wolves look like this
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.12,0:04:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks silly
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.80,0:04:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,A bit cruel
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.87,0:04:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,According to his characteristics
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.51,0:04:11.43,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no doubt that he is a wolf
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.59,0:04:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,A wolf?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.77,0:04:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,This scene seems a bit familiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.44,0:04:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I know
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.36,0:04:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw him being taken away by people from the city
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.24,0:04:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,you can go there and have a look
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.91,0:04:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to disguise yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.51,0:04:33.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise the soldiers here will take away a Bulala like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.31,0:04:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems that these Bulala are very important to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.45,0:04:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Give way
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.48,0:04:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m in a hurry
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.97,0:05:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,They are actually collecting cotton clouds
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.41,0:05:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,May I ask why you collect these?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.45,0:05:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.52,0:05:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the Bulala we depend on for survival
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.64,0:05:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don’t you hurry up and collect it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.85,0:05:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I’d better go to the city quickly and find Wolffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.85,0:05:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Humphrey told me not to go the wrong way
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.24,0:05:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The left side of the intersection leads to a cave.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.24,0:05:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,There’s a scary monster living inside
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.09,0:05:37.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You must not go
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.29,0:05:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s really dangerous
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.28,0:05:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I’d better leave quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.44,0:05:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,How? Did you find them?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.45,0:05:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,no
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.69,0:05:47.97,Default,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.77,0:05:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s like they disappeared from the whole world
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.56,0:05:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.24,0:05:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,they ran in
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.48,0:05:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,They won’t get into the rifts
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.92,0:05:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,As soon as they discovered such a strange thing
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.36,0:06:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,they will definitely notify us before taking any action.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.24,0:06:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Wolffy will also report it first.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.40,0:06:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But this time there is no news at all
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.16,0:06:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Mommy, look
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.49,0:06:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this Daddy’s invention?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.24,0:06:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy’s Exploding Paper Plane
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.00,0:06:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let’s go in and save people quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.04,0:06:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, everything inside is unknown.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.64,0:06:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,If you go in hastily, you won’t be able to do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.63,0:06:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,But Wolffy and Weslie are inside
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.75,0:06:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,We’re not sure if they’re in there either
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.35,0:06:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t know where this rift leads to
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.38,0:06:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,or whether there’s any danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.95,0:06:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,what is that
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.47,0:06:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What’s this
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.66,0:06:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,There’s something here too
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.42,0:06:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do these two materials blend together?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.16,0:06:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,kids
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.96,0:06:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,help me collect things
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.84,0:06:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,to the lab for research
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.48,0:06:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.84,0:06:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Slowy
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.03,0:06:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Planie
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.35,0:06:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you still doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.75,0:06:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You also come to help
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.75,0:07:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Set off
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.06,0:07:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s really far away
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.08,0:07:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s almost there. It’s almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.43,0:07:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What an amazing skill
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.83,0:07:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Help, who can help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.30,0:07:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Help, I’m so scared
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.70,0:07:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let go
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.26,0:07:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,But I want to pick Bulala
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.99,0:07:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Then climb up
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.78,0:07:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,But I’m afraid
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.70,0:07:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t be afraid I’m coming
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.62,0:07:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I can’t stand it anymore
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.89,0:08:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Come
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.73,0:08:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,hold me
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.93,0:08:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What’s going on
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.32,0:08:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,this person
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.13,0:08:44.41,Default,,0,0,0,,looks similar to me
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.01,0:08:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,,thank you for saving me
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.21,0:08:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,you
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.41,0:08:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Look similar to me
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.92,0:09:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You don’t look like a Bulala
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.34,0:09:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m from a place called Green Green Grassland
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.14,0:09:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Because something unexpected happened
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.02,0:09:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m here
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.41,0:09:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, have you ever seen this person?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.45,0:09:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ve seen
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.82,0:09:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,where have you seen him
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.50,0:09:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw him being picked up and brought home by a grandfather in the city
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.09,0:09:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Then can you take me to him now?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.61,0:09:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,But I am picking Bulala now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.74,0:09:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The time to pay tribute is very close
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.62,0:09:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It will be bad if I don’t pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.29,0:09:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you want to pay Bulala?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.61,0:09:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this rule?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.25,0:09:34.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, I didn’t have to pay it originally.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.33,0:09:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,But because not long ago
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.45,0:09:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,A monster ran out of nowhere
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.40,0:09:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The monster has sharp claws and destroys everywhere
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.20,0:09:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Fortunately, Master Quan discovered that the monster liked Bulala
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.32,0:09:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Let everyone offer Bulala to appease the monster
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.20,0:09:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure enough, the monster didn’t trouble us anymore after receiving Bulala.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.20,0:09:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,since then
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.04,0:09:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,All the Bulala we collect will be handed over to the soldiers
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.64,0:09:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it to the monster
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.80,0:09:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,only
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.68,0:10:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,the Monster needs
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.60,0:10:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,more and more Bulala
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.80,0:10:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Bulala
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.12,0:10:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,is getting harder and harder to pick.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.72,0:10:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Extra Large Bulala
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.68,0:10:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The quality of this Bulala is really good
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.12,0:10:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, he’s not
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.24,0:10:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m not
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.00,0:10:22.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Can still talk
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.39,0:10:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Since I was little, I have imagined that Bulala would talk to me
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.61,0:10:26.69,Default,,0,0,0,,let me go
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.37,0:10:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m not Bulala
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.49,0:10:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This Bulala can still move
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.48,0:10:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It can’t run away now
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.81,0:10:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,That, he is not
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.73,0:10:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Please wait for that
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.21,0:10:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Is there something else?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.00,0:10:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,He he is not my Bulala
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.28,0:10:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s just right
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.28,0:10:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the Bulala we picked
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.09,0:10:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s such good material
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.89,0:10:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,How could a coward like you collect it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.64,0:10:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,No, this is mine
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.84,0:10:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter if it’s yours or not
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.28,0:10:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s ours now
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.40,0:10:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,but but
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.64,0:11:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,waste our time
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.59,0:11:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What should I do now
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.47,0:11:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,He’s going to be sacrificed to the monster
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.61,0:11:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,This rare Bulala is really good
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.12,0:11:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,When we get back, we’ll shave off his Bulala.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.44,0:11:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Quan must be very happy to see it
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.12,0:11:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,reject
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.27,0:11:27.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Great, run quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.03,0:11:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,He runs fast
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.32,0:11:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Rare Bulala
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.51,0:11:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s Wolffy’s sticker
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.31,0:12:01.19,Default,,0,0,0,,The situation is different now
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.39,0:12:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You can’t catch me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.15,0:12:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to Wolffy
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.59,0:12:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You can’t even catch a single Bulala. Really useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.67,0:12:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Your batch of Bulala
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.91,0:12:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,is under our control now.
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
